window.products.push({"id":789107,"name":"The Original Whiskey Ball Quartet Gift Set (2 Pack Jumbo Ice Ball Mold)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AGlibMaXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A Japanese company has introduced a mold that easily creates a perfect sphere- no chipping and shaving required. Other mold units in the past used by high end bars cost a few hundred dollars. Now you can make the same ice spheres for a fraction of the cost! If you're wondering what's so great about giant ice balls, just think back to science class. The sizable frozen spheres have less surface area, so they melt slower. That means they're able to chill your drink and delay the evil diluting effects of melting long enough for you to enjoy your cocktail. No one likes watered down booze, so do yourself a favor and make the transition from fast-melting ice cubes to giant, beverage-saving ice balls. Thousands of fancy cocktail bars can't be wrong.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71AGlibMaXL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Whiskey Ball","source_asin":"B07C9CTRJ2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07C9CTRJ2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07C9CTRJ2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
