window.products.push({"id":789303,"name":"OQQOEE Wingback Recliner Chair with Massage & Heat Vibration, Fabric Push Back Accent Chairs Diamond Tufted Reclining Armchair for Living Room, Bedroo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":189.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QRLFOluGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ELEGANT DECORATION FOR YOUR HOME: Equipped with diamond tufting back, nailhead trim, wingback and oaken legs, the simple and stylish design makes our wingback recliner chair suit for most decoration style. Its light grey color will complement most furniture sets. Good choice for your living room, bedroom, office, apartment or small spaces. EASILY RECLINES: Sit back and relax in the wingback recliner chair. Just push on arms and lean against the back of the Elizabeth recliner, and the footstool will pop out to provide a comfortable position for your feet. Just press the footstool down with your feet and the accent chair will restore its original shape. COMFORTABLE WINGBACK RECLINER CHAIR: The seat cushion and backrest of this armchair are made of high-density sponge, which can provide you with maximum comfort. The comfy chair is wrapped in soft breathable linen fabric and filled with sponge, which has enough width and depth to provide you with hours of comfortable rest. LONG-TERM USE: With solid wood frame and oaken legs, the wingback recliner chair is strong enough to hold 250 pounds (static load capacity). The fabric of the cushion is not easy to pill and can be used for a long time. Its curved design is the perfect focal point for any room, and makes a great location for sitting, watching TV, reading, relaxing or you can napping the afternoon away. MASSAGE & HEAT FUNCTION: 5 different modes meet your demand of different massage, the 3 areas of massage focus thigh, lumbar and leg, you can freely choose the intensity and location of massage individually for full body relaxing at once. The chair is a little bit small so kindly please confirm the size before buying. Please install the legs according to the pictures and instructions. If you install them in the wrong direction, the wingback recliner chair will sway due to unbalanced forces.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81QRLFOluGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OQQOEE","source_asin":"B0BZNLXWKJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789303","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZNLXWKJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZNLXWKJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
