window.products.push({"id":789448,"name":"Solar Circle Bamboo Gongfu Tea Table Serving Tray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e1yleJLBL._AC_.jpg","description":"Chinese Gongfu style tea requires pouring away the water used to warm the teapot, tea brewer and cups, and the first rinse of the leaves is also discarded. Slatted trays with a water collection basin makes it easier to serve the tea. Preheat and rinse your cups and teapot using the interior of the tray to catch the waste water. Water then drains through the holes in the removable bamboo top, flowing down into the main part of the tray below. This tray is suitable for Gongfu-style tea service for 3~4 people using Gongfu teaware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41e1yleJLBL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"YEME","source_asin":"B01AHPIDS8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789448","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AHPIDS8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AHPIDS8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":789449,"name":"Temary Fabric Storage Baskets 3 Pcs Decorative Baskets Bins for Gifts Empty, Foldable Storage Baskets with Handles for Organizing Shelf, Home Closet (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.39,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rxk5rTrDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fabric 🙂STORAGE BASKET SIZE: 15 (L) x 11 (W) x 9.5 (H) inches, 3-PACK. Perfect for use as empty gift baskets. These canvas storage bins for a closet organization can meet many storage needs while keeping clothes and household items in the order 🙂PREMIUM QUALITY: The fabric storage baskets are made of durable fabric, which is more textured than ordinary plastic bins. The top is reinforced with a metal support frame, and the bottom of the storage bin is reinforced with heavy-duty stitching to maintain the shape of the clothes basket. The sturdy rope handles provide a strong and comfortable grip for easy pulling and carrying to ensure they can serve you for a long time 🙂MULTI-PURPOSE BASKETS: These decorative baskets provide a variety of storage needs for our life. The fabric storage bins can organize clothes, shoes, toys, toiletries, daily necessities, towels, diapers, etc. Shelf baskets for organizing can be used in bedrooms, living rooms, study rooms, offices, closets, and cabinets 🙂PRACTICAL & DECORATIVE DESIGN: High-quality material, sturdy and durable, Bring color and interest to a dull room with vibrant hues and a delicate appearance, make the home atmosphere more coordinated and comfortable. The storage basket is a foldable design. When not in use, the foldable storage is folded down, saves more space, is easy to store and carry 🙂USAGE TIPS: The basket set comes with compression packing which may result in wrinkled in long-distance transit, we advise filling in something or use iron to help recover the shape. The fabric baskets are easy to clean, dusting the basket with a soft dry cloth is recommended. Spot clean with light soapy water when needed. Not recommended to machine wash","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rxk5rTrDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Temary","source_asin":"B0B4JPZBQX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B4JPZBQX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B4JPZBQX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
