window.products.push({"id":789618,"name":"Popsicle Molds Silicone 4 Piece Set for Your Kids - BPA Free Popsicle Maker Mold That’s Easy to Use and Clean","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aP1BA3WtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"VERY EASY TO USE AND CLEAN. These BPA free popsicle molds silicone are super easy to use while making your own flavored drinks or smoothies and pouring them on this. Freeze them and you'll have FOUR ice pops ready to enjoy. Transforms Juice, Fruit, Yogurt and more into unique delicious ice pop treats inside your freezer. Great popsicle maker for summer activities, birthday parties, outdoor gatherings, and on other appropriate occasions! SUPER EASY TO FILL MOLDS. This is a great popsicle mold that lets you beat the heat by freezing your favorite juices, yogurt, or watermelon and strawberry shakes. The molds’ opening lets you fill up the popcicles mold silicone quickly. One popsicle measures 1.85” x 1.85” inches. These are easy to store and don’t take too much space in a tiny freezer. After using them, they are easy to clean, by simply washing them with soap and water. EASY TO REMOVE FROM THE MOLD. After freezing your purees or healthy drinks on the ice pop molds, each popsicle comes out perfectly. If it gets too frozen, you can run the molds under warm water when needed. No more messy eating while each ice pop melts on the drip tray. You can let the popsicle molds for kids stand alone, too! Perfect for healthy home made summer time treats. KIDS LOVE THEM. GREAT GIFT IDEA. The colorful and interesting shape of the silicone popsicle molds will make kids excited for making ice pops. The popsicle molds bpa free are sturdy and very kid-friendly with stylish simplicity. Its handle is just the perfect size for small hands to grip. Safe to use and looks awesome! Just pour your favorite flavored drinks into the BPA-free silicone molds, freeze, and enjoy! It is an excellent gift for your friends and family.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aP1BA3WtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ideas In Life","source_asin":"B082YJ36S8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789618","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082YJ36S8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082YJ36S8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
