window.products.push({"id":789622,"name":"WOLL Diamond Lite Pro Fry Pan, Diamond Reinforced Nonstick Skillet for Kitchen Use, 11 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618gPD14K2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ULTIMATE COOKING PAN: WOLL's Diamond Lite Pro Fry Pan is made in Germany and features a 5-layer design for enhanced longevity: a diamond reinforced topcoat, a long lasting nonstick base coat, a unique anti-corrosion layer, a hard cut-resistant base layer, and sandblasted aluminum. The durable topcoat cooks and cleans with ease and delivers excellent heat retention for efficient heating and even browning. NONSTICK FRYING PAN: WOLL cookware represents the next generation of diamond reinforced nonstick pans that use real diamonds for extreme durability and food release. These skillets are produced in a state-of-the-art factory in Germany developed exclusively for applying this coating. The diamond reinforced top coat layer provides the long lasting nonstick effect and excellent release properties which means that cleanup couldn't be easier. VERSATILE FRYING PAN: This nonstick pan is suitable for all types of stovetops, including electric and gas! It features a stainless steel handle and measures 11” in diameter. Whether you need to sear a steak or cook perfect vegetables, this professional grade pan will elevate your cooking experience. This premium quality fry pan allows you to become a chef in your own kitchen. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: To get the longest possible life from this premium quality, diamond reinforced nonstick pan, do not use metal utensils. This cookware can be used on medium heat and in the oven up to 500°F. This frying pan is PFOA-free and dishwasher safe. With proper care, this state-of-the-art skillet will remain sturdy and reliable for years of culinary adventures. WOLL QUALITY: Since 1979, WOLL has been producing high end, diamond reinforced nonstick cookware made exclusively in Germany. Now in its second generation of family ownership, WOLL uses state-of-the-art technology to provide the highest quality cookware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618gPD14K2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woll","source_asin":"B071ZTCN4Q","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789622","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071ZTCN4Q","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071ZTCN4Q","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
