window.products.push({"id":789654,"name":"Silvermark 4-Piece Gourmet Food Prep Set, Assorted Colors","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xmEbYHbUL._AC_.jpg","description":"In 2002, the world was introduced to Silvermark’s innovative Toss and Chop. The Toss and Chop was a sensation; it was very popular because of its unique, attractive and practical design. The Toss and Chop was widely distributed, sold worldwide and even found a place on Oprah’s O-list. To date, millions of Toss and Chops have been sold. Since 2002, the Silvermark line has expanded to include additional high quality, patented food preparation tools. The 4-Piece Gourmet Food Prep Set is a fantastic example. This unique knife set features four knives: the Mega Santoku, The Santoku, the Ultra Utility and the Mini Santoku. The Mega Santoku is a hybrid that combines the best features of the popular Santoku and the oversized chef’s knife; it has a contoured blade for easy chopping. The Santoku has the classic Japanese blade design that’s ideal for a variety of food prep assignments; it’s the most versatile knife in the kitchen. The Ultra Utility has a wavy blade combined with a rounded tip – perfect for cutting, slicing and spreading with the same knife. And the Mini Santoku – a scaled down version of the classic Santoku – is ideal for food prep assignments that require greater delicacy and precision. All knives feature well-balanced, heavy gauge, high-carbon, hollow ground stainless steel blades, which are coated with a non-stick material that prevents food from sticking. Offered in eye-catching, vibrant colors. Each knife comes with a protective sheath for protection, portability and safety. From Silvermark – Fresh. Healthy. Simple.Assorted Colors.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41xmEbYHbUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Silvermark","source_asin":"B001HL4S36","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789654","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001HL4S36","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001HL4S36","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
