window.products.push({"id":789714,"name":"Hillsdale Furniture Hillsdale Brandi, Oiled Bronze, Frame Not Included Queen Headboard","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":318.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F4YjiHcGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Hillsdale Furniture Brandi Headboard only is ideal for a wide variety of décor schemes. Its simple pipe fittings and bun feet are understated and subtle. Closely placed spindles give the illusion of greater width -- while maintaining a sleek profile. Constructed of sturdy metal. The oiled bronze metal finish is both handsome and versatile. This queen-size metal Headboard has everything you need to upgrade your bedroom style. Headboard only is included. Metal headboard frame, box spring and mattress not included but required. Assembly required.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71F4YjiHcGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hillsdale","source_asin":"B07F21LMDL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789714","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F21LMDL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F21LMDL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":789715,"name":"Vktech® Flashing Light Up Spikey High Bouncing Balls Novelty Sensory Hedgehog Ball","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z8yUqUKmL._AC_.jpg","description":"Material is nontoxic TPR. It can make a sound. It can put the multi-colored LED insaide the puffer ball to flash, unusual in dark. Suitable for children age above 3year's old(not recommended for children under 3). Motion activate LED light. Led light start blinking when you Catch It Throw It Squeeze It or Hit It, very funny for kids and adult. Automatic shut off in 15-30 sec. Ready for another Throw. Batteries are included with Fluffy Ball. Great for party favors Play with them outdoors at night. Color:We don't offer color choice,your order will be sent in colors at random. Includes : 1 X Flashing Light Up Spikey Ball","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Z8yUqUKmL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Vktech","source_asin":"B00YE5R0UU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YE5R0UU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YE5R0UU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":789716,"name":"Mara Ceramic Stoneware 16 Oz. Dogs Mug (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.34,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g4TBBCKFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Listing is for 2 16 Oz. Mugs which measure 5 inches x 3.75 inches x 4.25 inches each. Mara, an accomplished painter, sculptor and ceramicist, studied engraving with the famous artist Alfredo Zalce, who painted many portraits of his lovely artist protégé. After studying art in London, she began working with high-temperature ceramics and created wonderfully unique glazes for her pieces. She then went on to study with the Italian ceramist, Bruno Terese, in Italy. Mara has had numerous expositions of her original pieces in Europe, the United States and Mexico. \"She has developed a fine sensibility in schematic and precise line drawings. Ceramics is no easy medium for precise line drawings, yet Mara has mastered her technique with brush and stylus and has been able to portray her life experiences with unrivaled naturalness. We see her universe on parade in all of her pieces, whether they be vases or plaques. Flowers, birds and geometric designs all represent her personal vision and display her unique perceptions of the world.\" Alfredo Zalce, May 1994 Sadly, after a long illness, Mara passed away in November 2007. Since Ceramica Mara has always been an extended family operation, production of her fine works has continued. Mara's husband, daughter and loyal apprentices have consistently carried out day to day production. Her husband Mariano, an architect, artist and Ceramica Mara business manager, is passionate about continuing Mara's legacy. Her daughter Alexandra, artist and history professor, has also stepped in to help the family make a seamless transition in the continuation of the fine production of Ceramica Mara.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51g4TBBCKFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mara Ceramic Stoneware","source_asin":"B0087AQW9S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789716","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0087AQW9S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0087AQW9S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":789717,"name":"Mulberry Park 100% Pure Queen Silk Duvet Cover - 22 Momme Grade 6A Mulberry Silk Duvet Covers for Hair and Skin, 1 pc Full/Queen Silk Duvet Cover (Ros","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":425.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815R3roheeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ultra Soft And Breathable: Mulberry Park Silk charmeuse bedding is all made of 100% natural Mulberry silk and this momme silk fabric is made of all organic ingredients. Silk helps prevent abrasion of the skin, help retain moisture and beneficial in wrinkle prevention. Dermatologists, Hairstylists and Beauty Experts all recommend silk for people with sensitive skin or acne! What You Will Receive: One (1) - 100% pure 22 Momme Silk, double-sided Duvet Cover with button closure. Duvet covers include 4 inside corner ties. Our silk is OEKO-TEX Certified (Standard 100) and dyed with environmentally friendly dyes with no color shading or fading. Sleep Better, Sleep Beautifully: With our ultra-soft and smooth silk duvet cover, wake up with healthier skin, less tangles, less frizzy hair or bed head - imagine your mornings with smoother and more manageable hair! Mulberry Park Silk fabric is designed to naturally help regulate your body temperature. Silk duvet covers will feel cooler to your skin in the summer and warmer in the winter and will help you to get a good night's sleep. Many Benefits Of Silk: Our silk duvet covers contain 18 different amino acids that are used in many high-end body lotions, skin and hair treatment products -- just imagine the benefits of sleeping in silk! Silk is a breathable fabric helping to retain moisture, prevent wrinkles and wonderful source of nourishment and maintenance for your hair and skin. Our silk bedding is machine washable and shrinkage resistant. Our 22 Momme silk has high tensile strength, making it strong and durable. Proud American Company: Mulberry Park Silk was named \"Best Overall Sheet Set\" by both Women's Health and Prevention's online magazine in its recent ranking of top silk bedding. As a silk loving company located in CT, we know nothing is more important than a great night's sleep! If for any reason your silk pillowcase isn't right for you, please reach out to us and we will be happy to make it right!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/815R3roheeL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mulberry Park Silks","source_asin":"B0BSP4533D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789717","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSP4533D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSP4533D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
