window.products.push({"id":789736,"name":"Reusable Grocery Shopping Bags Foldable with Pouch, Heavy Duty Nylon Cloth Reusable Bags for Groceries, Shopping Trip (Leaves, 6-pcs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CCsD61itL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Best Choice of Gift One pack of the shopping bag constitutes 6 roomy tote bags with various patterns, which are perfectly applicable to grocery shopping, farmer market, seaside holiday or travel souvenir shopping. Makes it be an adorable gift with the colorful patterns to delight people, as well as quite a practical gift to share with your family, friends for holidays and birthdays. Reusable for Eco-friendly Life-style The shopping bag can be easily cleaned by washer for reusing, meaning that no longer have all the toxic plastic bags at home. Above all, how many plastic bags you will help to eliminate for our mother earth! The more of us use the reusable totes, the greater impact we will make on the earth. This reusable shopping bag just aims to create a future with a green, happy and healthy planet and we need you to join us! Sturdy with Large 35lbs Loading Capacity Made of durable 210T nylon material with fine stitching, this shopping bag is sturdy enough to withstand weight up to 35lbs. Moreover, the widened long handles of these tote bags are continuous with the body so the handle not only allows you to place it over shoulder, but also helps improving the weight limit. Large Volume to Hold More Measuring 15” (L) x 1.5” (W) x 13.5” (H), these totes are bigger and much sturdier than average plastic grocery bags. Able to hold a ton with 1 trip which is equivalent to 2 trips back and forth from the car to the store with plastic bag for grocery shopping. And no worry about it getting dirty for the nylon material that can be washed and dry quick. Fold into a Tiny Square for Easy Storage Do you always think “OH, well, I forgot my shopping bags again” every time you are on the way to market? But no such problem with these shopping bags! It can be easily folded up into the attached pouch and small enough to fit in pocket. Then you won’t forget them during next trip!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91CCsD61itL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ifavo","source_asin":"B07KPRFJ75","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07KPRFJ75","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07KPRFJ75","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
