window.products.push({"id":789818,"name":"Bling Rhinestone Double Walled Rhinestone Tumbler | Reusable, Travel, Plastic, Hot/Cold, Splash Proof, Easy to Clean, 16 oz., with Push on Lid and Reu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bErF7zn8L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"This 16 fl. oz. tumbler is handcrafted with just under 3,000 high-quality crystals from the lid to base of the cup!! Talk about a head turner! This bling rhinestone tumbler is stunning and is a perfect gift to yourself or anyone in you know that's about that bling life. Our rhinestone tumblers are handcrafted with the highest quality, machine cut rhinestones, which means a more precise cut rhinestone and more facets on each rhinestone to bounce the light. This 16 oz bling rhinestone tumbler is available in clear and rose gold rhinestones and comes with a clear reusable straw. The tumbler's base is designed to fit into standard cup holder sizes, making it the perfect drinkware on-the-go. 💎 HOURS OF TEMPERATURE CONTROL: Our premium tumblers are made of high quality acrylic construction with a push-on lid with inner seal ring that allows for even temperature retention to keep cold drinks chilled and hot drinks toasty, with a temperature rating of up to 175 degrees Fahrenheit. Cold drinks will stay cold for 9+ hours and hot drinks will stay hot for 3+ hours. And the best part, the double walled construction means you’ll never have to deal with annoying drink “sweat” or water rings ruining your surfaces, either! 💎 SPLASH-PROOF AND EASY TO CLEAN: Our gorgeous bling tumbler a great way to make long days at the office a tad more doable, stay hydrated during hardcore gym workouts, sip on iced tea or coffee while shopping with your bestie, or cooling down at the beach with a refreshing smoothie or iced drink. These lightweight tumblers are an absolute breeze to quickly hand wash when needed. 💎 Surprise your family, friends or BFF with this gorgeous bling tumbler or include these rhinestone tumblers in wedding party and bridal shower gift bags!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bErF7zn8L._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kellee Collective","source_asin":"B08KYPZX49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789818","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KYPZX49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KYPZX49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
