window.products.push({"id":789831,"name":"Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts Personalized Christmas Ornaments - Christmas Decor, Crystal Glass Ornament, Wedding Year Christmas Ornament, Holiday Custom ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MbBVWajDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SLEEK ORNAMENT DESIGN: Add a minimalist style and elegance to your Christmas tree with our crystal wedding ornaments. It adds a perfect personal touch to your Christmas decorations at home and makes an excellent conversation starter for your guests, which is perfect this holiday season. MAKE IT PERSONALIZED: With our modern crystal ornament, you can create a warm and cozy Christmas atmosphere this season. Personalize your holiday decorations with your chosen name, year, and anniversary date. You'll have a personalized keepsake to remember each holiday season. HIGH-GRADE QUALITY: Our crystal ornaments are laser-etched using the most advanced lasers on the market and a highly trained laser engraving team with decades of experience in Virginia, USA. Our quality control team checks each order to provide the quality and most beautiful crystal display possible. This is made of extra thick 1/8\" crystal glass for a great look and durability, handcrafted with great care and attention to detail that can last for years. SURPRISING GIFT: Create a beautiful keepsake ornament to commemorate a particular day, like an anniversary or wedding day. You can hang it on the Christmas tree or give it as a surprise engagement gift, anniversary gift for a couple, and Mr and Mrs gift to your friends and family. PACKAGE INCLUSION: Our crystal wedding ornaments are a beautiful way to celebrate your new chapter. Each ornament has a red ribbon to hang on your tree and is wrapped in a 4.5\" X 4.5\" X 1\" box for easy gift-giving. Let this modern crystal ornament help you spread the holiday cheer!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MbBVWajDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Ridge Mountain Gifts","source_asin":"B09T2VVD1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-789831","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09T2VVD1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09T2VVD1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
